      "content": "Your baby tasted your dinner last night 🍽️\n\nBy 21 weeks, a fetus is swallowing amniotic fluid that carries the exact flavor molecules from everything you eat.\n\nStudies show babies exposed to garlic, vanilla, or carrot in the womb consistently prefer those flavors after birth.\n\nWhat you eat during pregnancy shapes their palate before they're even born.\n\n#pregnancyfacts #fetaldevelopment #babyfacts #newborn #pregnancytips #expectingmom",
